*1 [[Project A]] spawns after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'Solar]] spawns after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>.

===<u>Chapter 2</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Star Peng|Project A|Cli-One}}
