*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
This stage is fairly easy, as Project A can help your attackers survive longer. You can use [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]
to break Le'Solar's Barrier. He can also kill the remaining Star Pengs and Project A as long as he is protected during his backswing animation.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
This version of this stage is similar to the first version, as the only difference is Le'Solar being replaced with a Cli-One. You can still use Awakened Bahamut, but you should also use crowd-controllers such as [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] to prevent Cli-One from killing and weakening your units.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
This version of this stage is almost the exact same, as the only added enemies are Mesocosmocyclones and a single Maawth, which can be easily dealt with using crowd-control units mentioned before. Awakened Bahamut Cat can be used if all enemies are properly frozen, as his high damage allows him to shred through most threats in this stage.

