==Trivia==
*The robot on the enemy base is a parody unit based on [[wikia:gundam:NZ-333 α Azieru|Alpha Azieru]] from ''[[wikipedia:Mobile Suit Gundam: Char's Counterattack|Mobile Suit Gundam: Char's Counterattack]]'', riding the Pegasus White Base.
*Mertoz on the [[Cats of the Cosmos]] map is shaped similarly to the asteroid base [[wikia:gundam:Axis|Axis]] from the ''Mobile Suit Gundam'' series.

